#  docs/wiki/rules/module-theme-root-cleanup.md)
# ==============================================
scripts/
bashscripts/
docs/archive/
docs/archived/
docs/legacy/
docs/workbench/
.circleci/
.claude-audit/
tests/.claude-audit/
_bmad-output/
test-results/
.devcontainer/
